            "review_title": "Review at NHÀ NÂU- ẨM THỰC VIỆT",
            "review_text": "Susan M\nSaint Robert6 contributions\n0\nEating well in Đà Nẵng, Việt Nam!\nMay 2024 • Family\nThis was the second time we've enjoyed a meal here. Splendid! The servers were outgoing, polite, and helpful.\nThe food was excellent. We enjoyed mì với rau, noodles with veggies and sườn heo rotisseri, rotisserie pork ribs, khoai tây chiên, French fries, and cơm, white rice. \n\nThe entire staff, the greeters, the servers, the cooking staff, was welcoming and friendly. \n\nI strongly recommend this as a lunch or dinner stop for any tourists visiting Marble Mountain.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten May 5, 2024",
